Architectural acknowledgement
-----------------------------
The subsystem decomposition used here -- a provider-transport abstraction
behind a single agent orchestrator, a self-registering tool registry grouped
into toolsets, progressive-disclosure skills, an SQLite session store with
full-text search, and a multi-platform chat gateway sharing one process -- was
informed by studying Hermes Agent by Nous Research
(https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent), which is also MIT licensed.

No source code, prompt text, or documentation was copied from that project.
Where this project departs from those designs, the reasoning is recorded in
docs/architecture.md.
